    <bpmn:process id="W_W2181" name="W2181. Planogram Change Implementation Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Every planogram deployment to stores
Frequency: ~1,500–2,000 implementations/year
Volume: ~125–170/month
Owner: Merchandising Coordinator
Participants: Merch Coordinator, Store Manager, Regional Ops
Source: workflow W2181 — Planogram Change Implementation Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2181_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2181_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2181_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2181_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2181_Lane2" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2181_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2181_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2181_Start4" name="Every planogram deployment to stores">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2181_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2181_Task5" name="System distributes the change package via the store app (zone maps, labels…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System distributes the change package via the store app (zone maps, labels, instructions, deadline — the output of W2166); Store Manager acknowledges and assigns the stock team
Responsible (R): System / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Merch Coordinator
Duration: 15 min + 4–8 hrs execution</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2181_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2181_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2181_Task6" name="Store Manager submits the completion photos; Coordinator verifies within 48…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Manager submits the completion photos; Coordinator verifies within 48 hours; non-compliant stores receive a remediation request and escalation to Regional Ops if not resolved by the deadline
Responsible (R): Store Manager / Merch Coordinator
Accountable (A): Regional Ops Mgr
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2181_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2181_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2181_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2181_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-395 (ensure controlled execution — Planogram Compliance &amp; Audit (PA-55.2).) | - operational: planogram-version implementation; operational: Coordinator verification sign-off per implementation
Owner: Merchandising Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
